         "value": "<h2>Are These Fossils Real?</h2><p>Did you know the Triceratops you see today in the David H. Koch Hall of Fossils – Deep Time at the Smithsonian National Museum of Natural History is not made of real fossils?</p><p><a href=\"https://3d-api.si.edu/content/document/3d_package:d8c623be-4ebc-11ea-b77f-2e728ce88125/articles/new-article-uTRGn3tMSDKh-0.html\">Read the article: Are These Fossils Real?</a></p>",
